<title>LITHUANIA: Yields rise on 182-day Lithuanian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yields rise on 182-day Lithuanian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields rose on 182-day Lithuanian Treasury bills at Tuesday's auction and the 50 million litas issue undersubscribed, the country's central bank said.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV.YIELD  LAST  MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID     SOLD</p>
<p>182-days    9.64    8.63 8.93/9.97    50   16.929  13.929</p>
<p>The settlement date is June 20 and the bills mature on December 19.</p>
<p>The next auction is on June 23 when 50 million litas of 91-day paper will be offered.</p>
<p>-- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
